
# Third-party skill library — reproducible via git clone (see src/tools/security.mjs)
vendor/

# Media generation: isolated venv (reproducible via media/requirements.txt) and outputs
media/.venv/
media/out/

# Files Grayson drops on a chat window. Ignored for a stronger reason than the
# generated output above is: this folder is whatever he happened to send —
# a contract, a bank statement, a photograph of his family, a screenshot of
# something he was in the middle of. None of it is source, all of it is
# private, and a repo is the last place any of it should end up.
media/drops/

# Reference pictures for brands and looks — his artwork, not source, and the
# same reasoning as the drops folder above. The README is the exception: it is
# what tells anyone finding an empty folder what it is for, so ignoring it too
# would mean a fresh checkout has neither the pictures nor the explanation.
media/refs/*
!media/refs/README.md
